      "message": "rpc: unify the TX decode failure error message\n\nThe advice \"Make sure the tx has at least one input.\" was added\ndeliberately in #19836 for the zero-input case, but the same error\ncovers every DecodeHexTx() failure: invalid hex, incomplete or\nmalformed serialization, and trailing bytes. Move the advice into one\ninline constexpr string_view constant (TX_DECODE_ERROR_HINT) in\nrpc/util.h, and use it in sendrawtransaction, testmempoolaccept,\nsubmitpackage, generateblock, combinerawtransaction,\nsignrawtransactionwithkey, signrawtransactionwithwallet, and\nimportprunedfunds.\n\nArray RPCs no longer echo the offending hex (potentially hundreds of\nKB): they report the failing element's index, as combinerawtransaction\nalready did.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "MrHodlX",
        "email": "289396684+MrHodlX@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-09-16T14:07:53Z"
